  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Electoral and Legislative Processes Project (SELP II)UNDP-PAK-00134119</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at providing technical assistance to the Election Commission of Pakistan in line with its recommendations to the Needs Assessment Mission and the Project Formulation Mission. Spanning over three years, the project is divided into two phases, with Phase I covering the period up to the conduct of the next general elections and Phase II focusing on the post-election period. The project is planned across three key outputs, all of which assist the ECP in timely and effective implemen</narrative>
  </description>
